    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im in my garden and just accidentally poked my foot pretty deep with an old rusty trowel. it's bleeding a bit but not like a lot. can i just wash it out with some soap and peroxide and put a bandaid on it? i really dont want to go to the doctors if i dont have to",
