    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, is peroxide really the best thing? I heard that can sometimes damage the tissue and make it heal slower. And honestly, the puncture felt pretty deep, like it went past the surface. Are you sure I don't need to get a tetanus shot or something? I haven't had one in years.",
